[[File:Juggler PM.png|thumb|200px|The Chansey torturer in disguise as a Juggler in Pokémon Pocket Monsters]]
A Juggler makes an appearance in Pokémon Pocket Monsters in ''[[PM015|Save The Chansey!]]'', where he is seen performing with some {{p|Chansey}}.

{{PPM|Red}} went to his show after two {{p|Machamp}} threw him, {{TP|Red|Clefairy}} and {{PPM|Red's Pikachu|Pikachu}} in a lake. The show was popular as many people went to see it. After the show, Clefairy criticized the Juggler for his treatment of the Chansey. During the nighttime, Red found out that the Juggler was a Chansey torturer that [[Koga]] hired.

